      "writtenOn": "2026-06-09T11:34:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also just noticed that you are using a BUG_ON instead of returning an error. Whereas this condition may be caused by a malicious host, not by a pKVM bug? So it\u0027s probably better to just return an error to the host instead? (Which is easy if we re-check this before copying pvmfw and mapping pages for the guest, not after?).",
      "revId": "fe77de2d1d92d36de59b90c9ee06ebcdcf406f9c",
